{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["Only the trees of which you know, etc. — A barren tree, whether close to the city or far from the city, you may destroy to build siege works. But a fruit tree that is far — you must not cut down; only one close to the city that blocks the troops from approaching the wall." "Of which you know — that you recognize." "Until it fall — until its walls fall. As it is written: עד רדת חומותיך הגבוהות והבצורות."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:39:14.249312309Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}